<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: hungry for prey -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.hungry_for_prey.label>渴求猎物</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.hungry_for_prey.label>
  <!-- EN: The craving for live prey is becoming distracting. -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.hungry_for_prey.description>我总是不由自主地想着活生生的猎物，这些念头一阵阵冒出来，让我越来越难以集中精神。</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.hungry_for_prey.description>
  <!-- EN: desperate for prey -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.desperate_for_prey.label>迫切渴求猎物</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.desperate_for_prey.label>
  <!-- EN: The need to digest live prey is weighing heavily on the mind. -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.desperate_for_prey.description>我满脑子都是吞下并消化活物的需要，这种渴望沉甸甸地压在我心头，让我很难再去在意别的事。</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.desperate_for_prey.description>
  <!-- EN: ravaged by hunger -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.ravaged_by_hunger.label>饥渴折磨</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.ravaged_by_hunger.label>
  <!-- EN: The body's desperate need for prey leaves little room for anything else. -->
  <RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.ravaged_by_hunger.description>我的身体在尖叫着渴求猎物，饥饿几乎占满了我全部的念头，我很难再顾及其他事情。</RS_VoreDependencyMood.stages.ravaged_by_hunger.description>
  
